WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:06.979
Hey Thoughty2 here, nature often presents
us with some rather uncanny and unexplainable

00:00:06.979 --> 00:00:07.979
events.

00:00:07.979 --> 00:00:19.990
Here are some of the strangest natural occurrences
of all time.

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:27.051
Angel hair is a rare phenomenon where extremely
fine silken threads fall from the sky, it

00:00:27.051 --> 00:00:30.619
has been described as similar to cobwebs.

00:00:30.619 --> 00:00:36.590
However it is extremely delicate and appears
to completely vanish when you touch it.

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:42.750
The phenomenon has been witnessed most often
in North America, Australia, New Zealand and

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:44.550
Western Europe.

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:49.620
There is no known evidence that tells us where
this strange substance comes from or what

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:50.900
it's made up of.

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:57.490
The material's extreme sensitivity makes it
almost impossible to collect and analyse.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:02.900
Many believe it is linked to UFO sightings
as many have reported seeing angel hair at

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:05.720
suspected UFO crash locations.

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:12.750
There have also been reports of angel hair
sightings at the Miracle of the Sun in Fatima.

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:18.790
In June 1908 a ball of fire exploded in a
remote area of Russia.

00:01:18.790 --> 00:01:26.470
It caused localised earthquakes and instantly
flattened 80 million trees over an area of

00:01:26.470 --> 00:01:28.410
830 square miles.

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:35.260
An explosion of such magnitude would have
been capable of wiping out an entire city,

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:39.590
however because the area is so remote there
were no fatalities.

00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:46.140
It is now known as the Tunguska event because
of it's close proximity to the Tunguska river.

00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:53.400
The blast reached 15 megatons of energy, that's
a thousand times more powerful than the Hiroshima

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.280
Bomb.

00:01:55.280 --> 00:02:01.040
Research suggests the explosion was caused
by an asteroid impact, because a nearby lake

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:05.090
is believed to have been created by the impact.

00:02:05.090 --> 00:02:10.010
However other researchers say the lake was
there before the event.

00:02:10.010 --> 00:02:16.450
Over 1,000 scholarly papers have been published
on the event, however we still don't know

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:19.920
for certain what happened that day.

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:26.220
If you think fire balls are weird, how about
intelligent balls of lightning?

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:33.400
Ball lightning as it's known is a seemingly
paranormal phenomena where a sphere of lightning

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:38.310
appears and flies around in an autonomous
fashion.

00:02:38.310 --> 00:02:45.020
Ball lightning has a life span of less than
five seconds, it can appear randomly at any

00:02:45.020 --> 00:02:48.450
location during a thunderstorm.

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:55.120
However the creepiest thing about ball lightning
is that it acts as though it has intelligence

00:02:55.120 --> 00:02:56.190
of its own.

00:02:56.190 --> 00:03:03.230
It usually enters buildings through a window
or door, it avoids colliding with objects

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:07.640
and navigates itself through hallways.

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:13.730
Also witnesses say ball lightning can pass
through walls however sometimes it leaves

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:20.150
a hole in the wall and other times it passes
through without leaving a trace.

00:03:20.150 --> 00:03:24.170
As if it can do what it wants.

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:31.470
One of the first documented sightings of ball
lighting was in January 1984, according to

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:38.810
eye witnesses ball lightning approximately
4 inches in diameter entered a Russian passenger

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:46.260
aircraft, flew above the heads of the passengers,
then once it reached the tail section, split

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:53.690
into two glowing crescents then joined together
again and exited the plane.

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:58.050
It left two holes in the walls of the plane.

00:03:58.050 --> 00:04:04.940
Because this natural phenomenon is so rare
there is currently no generally accepted theory

00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:11.379
for ball lightning, and it has baffled scientists
for centuries.

00:04:11.379 --> 00:04:18.940
In 2,000 in Ethiopia fish fell from the sky,
yes that's right.

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:24.610
A local newspaper reported: "The unusual rain
of fish, which dropped in millions from the

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:31.430
air - some dead and others still struggling
- created panic amongst the mostly religious

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:32.430
farmers.".

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:37.580
But this is not the only account of raining
animals, far from it.

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:44.590
In fact almost every year since records began
there have been reports all around the world

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:52.400
of animals miraculously raining down from
the sky, in some cases hundreds of miles from

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:54.580
the nearest body of water.

00:04:54.580 --> 00:05:03.340
But it's not just fish, people have also reported
raining frogs, snakes and even alligators.

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:08.650
Science says the most likely explanation for
this phenomena is a type of tornado called

00:05:08.650 --> 00:05:12.590
a waterspout which forms above water.

00:05:12.590 --> 00:05:19.759
A waterspout has enough sucking power to suck
up masses of water as well as any animals

00:05:19.759 --> 00:05:21.580
it contains.

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:27.160
Once the animals have been sucked into the
upper atmosphere they can be carried by winds

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:34.600
hundreds of miles until they eventually fall
back to earth as rain.

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:43.330
In the summer of 1997 an ultra-low frequency
sound was detected underwater by the US National

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:46.750
Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration.

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:52.400
It sounded like this.

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:55.420
The sound was affectionately named "The Bloop".

00:05:55.420 --> 00:06:05.190
The Bloop was so loud it was picked up on
multiple sensors over 5,000 kilometres apart.

00:06:05.190 --> 00:06:10.300
According to scientists who have studied the
Bloop, it matches the audio profile of a living

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:18.500
creature, however there is no known animal
that could have produced a sound of such amplitude.

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:25.340
If it did come from an animal it would have
to be several times the size of a blue whale.

00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:32.050
Which led to speculations all over the internet
of a giant underwater sea monster.

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:40.330
However, after many years of scientists being
baffled by the Bloop, NOAA recently discovered

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:47.990
the noise was caused by an ice quake in Antarctica,
which is when an ice shelf cracks.

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:55.500
An estimated 2 to 10% of the world's population
are plagued by a relentless, mysterious humming

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:58.320
sound of un-known origin.

00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:02.620
This unexplainable phenomena is known as "The
Hum".

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:08.570
Scientists have investigated the hum multiple
times, however in places where the hum has

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:15.150
reportedly been heard, scientists could never
locate the source of the sound.

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:20.370
Which makes investigating this peculiar phenomenon
rather difficult.

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:26.889
According to sufferers of the hum it sounds
similar to a diesel engine truck idling outside

00:07:26.889 --> 00:07:28.110
their house.

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:34.289
But what's even weirder about this strange
sound is that it isn't present everywhere,

00:07:34.289 --> 00:07:38.560
it can only be heard in certain places.

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:47.120
Notable places the Hum has been heard in include
Taos, New Mexico, Bristol, England and Largs

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:48.120
in Scotland.

00:07:48.120 --> 00:07:54.509
But the hum is constantly appearing in new
towns and cities across the world, it has

00:07:54.509 --> 00:08:01.259
become such a global problem that a website
was started that keeps track of every location

00:08:01.259 --> 00:08:04.840
the hum has been heard around the world.

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:11.210
Perhaps one of the weirdest natural phenomena
of all are Rods.

00:08:11.210 --> 00:08:18.990
Rods were discovered accidentally in March
of 1994 by filmmaker Jose Escamilla.

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:24.890
Rods are peculiar flying entities that can
only be seen on slowed down videotape and

00:08:24.890 --> 00:08:27.960
sometimes in still photographs.

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:34.579
Rods are cylindrical shaped objects that travel
too fast to be seen by the naked eye and move

00:08:34.579 --> 00:08:39.269
through the air like a fish moves through
the sea.

00:08:39.269 --> 00:08:44.869
Because of the speed they travel they have
never been studied by science but there are

00:08:44.869 --> 00:08:49.550
many theories as to what rods really are.

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:55.839
Some believe they are secret high tech missiles
being tested by the government, because they

00:08:55.839 --> 00:08:59.420
appear to travel in a absolute straight line.

00:08:59.420 --> 00:09:05.059
Others theorise that they are entities from
another dimension, briefly passing through

00:09:05.059 --> 00:09:07.649
our dimension in a split second.

00:09:07.649 --> 00:09:37.149
Or the could simply be another species of
insect still unknown to science.

